        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Phoebe Ruguru, Njue Kevin, Bill Jones Afwani\n- Products: Saidia, iPhone 4S\n- Companies: Apple Inc.\n\nFacts:\n- Phoebe Ruguru’s winning film \"Saidia\" was shot entirely on her iPhone 4s with her producer friends Njue Kevin and Bill Jones Afwani.\n- The iPhone 4S is a smartphone designed and marketed by Apple Inc.\n- The iPhone 4S is the fifth generation of the iPhone, succeeding the iPhone 4 and preceding the iPhone 5.\n- As of September 2013, Apple Inc. retroactively stylized the product name as iPhone 4s with a lowercase \"s\".",
